{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusFooter","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StatusFooter"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["[status] room=Front Hall | moves=12 | score=0 | turn=cost | time=5:46 pm"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A transcript is prose, and prose does not say where you are standing or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what the last command cost. A tester reading one back has to reconstruct","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both, and the reconstruction is where the mistakes come from: counting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"commands as turns is wrong the moment one of them fails to parse or turns","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out to be a meta verb, and “which room was that?” is a scroll upwards.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"moves=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"turn="},{"type":"text","text":" answer the first; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"room="},{"text":" answers the second.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A contributed field like ","type":"text"},{"code":"time=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" answers a third — ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"when","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — and is sampled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at the turn’s close rather than after its counter advanced, so that it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names the minute the turn’s own words were